        {
          "name": "crossDocking",
          "type": "Boolean!",
          "description": "- **Description**: Areas where incoming products are immediately prepared for outbound shipping\n- **Characteristics**:Minimal or no storage time\nLocated near both receiving and shipping docks\nFocused on speed of throughput\n\n- **Best for**: Pre-allocated orders, promotional items, seasonal products\n- **Layout considerations**: Staging areas with clear demarcation for order consolidation",
          "metadata": {
            "mfgx": {
              "mutations": {
                "create": {
                  "include": true
                },
                "update": {
                  "include": true
                }
              },
              "queries": {
                "include": true
              },
              "where": {
                "include": true
              },
              "defaultValue": false
            },
            "unique": false
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "fastMoving",
          "type": "Boolean!",
          "description": "- **Description**: Areas dedicated to high-velocity products that have frequent picks\n- **Characteristics**:Located near packing stations to minimize travel distance\nOptimized for easy access and quick retrieval\nOften feature forward pick locations\n\n- **Best for**: Top 20% of SKUs that generate 80% of picking activity\n- **Layout considerations**: Usually at waist or chest height to minimize bending/reaching",
          "metadata": {
            "mfgx": {
              "mutations": {
                "create": {
                  "include": true
                },
                "update": {
                  "include": true
                }
              },
              "queries": {
                "include": true
              },
              "where": {
                "include": true
              },
              "defaultValue": false
            },
            "unique": false
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "hazardous",
          "type": "Boolean!",
          "description": "- **Description**: Segregated areas for dangerous or regulated substances\n- **Characteristics**:Special safety equipment and protocols\nOften have restricted access\nMay need specialized ventilation or containment\n\n- **Best for**: Chemicals, flammables, corrosives, regulated substances\n- **Layout considerations**: Generally separated from main picking areas, with special handling requirements",
          "metadata": {
            "mfgx": {
              "mutations": {
                "create": {
                  "include": true
                },
                "update": {
                  "include": true
                }
              },
              "queries": {
                "include": true
              },
              "where": {
                "include": true
              },
              "defaultValue": false
            },
            "unique": false
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "highValue",
          "type": "Boolean!",
          "description": "- **Description**: Secured areas for expensive or theft-prone items\n- **Characteristics**:Limited access controls (key cards, biometrics)\nAdditional surveillance\nMay require two-person verification for picking\n\n- **Best for**: Electronics, luxury goods, controlled substances, high-value components\n- **Layout considerations**: Caged areas, locked cabinets, separate security protocols",
          "metadata": {
            "mfgx": {
              "mutations": {
                "create": {
                  "include": true
                },
                "update": {
                  "include": true
                }
              },
              "queries": {
                "include": true
              },
              "where": {
                "include": true
              },
              "defaultValue": false
            },
            "unique": false
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "kitting",
          "type": "Boolean!",
          "description": "- **Description**: Areas where multiple items are combined into kits or assembled before shipping\n- **Characteristics**:Work tables or assembly stations\nMultiple item pick access\nOften involves specialized packaging\n\n- **Best for**: Product bundles, gift sets, items requiring assembly\n- **Layout considerations**: Need workspace and access to component parts",
          "metadata": {
            "mfgx": {
              "mutations": {
                "create": {
                  "include": true
                },
                "update": {
                  "include": true
                }
              },
              "queries": {
                "include": true
              },
              "where": {
                "include": true
              },
              "defaultValue": false
            },
            "unique": false
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "overflow",
          "type": "Boolean!",
          "description": "- **Description**: Flexible spaces that can be repurposed based on seasonal needs\n- **Characteristics**:Less permanent storage solutions\nMay be used differently throughout the year\nCan serve as buffer capacity\n\n- **Best for**: Holiday merchandise, seasonal products, promotional items\n- **Layout considerations**: Modular storage that can be reconfigured",
          "metadata": {
            "mfgx": {
              "mutations": {
                "create": {
                  "include": true
                },
                "update": {
                  "include": true
                }
              },
              "queries": {
                "include": true
              },
