        },
        {
          "name": "refrigerated",
          "type": "Boolean!",
          "description": "- **Description**: Temperature-controlled areas for perishable items\n- **Characteristics**:Maintain specific temperature ranges\nMay have different picking equipment requirements\nOften require expedited picking processes to maintain cold chain\n\n- **Best for**: Food products, pharmaceuticals, chemicals requiring temperature control\n- **Layout considerations**: Need to minimize door openings and time spent retrieving products",
          "metadata": {
            "mfgx": {
              "mutations": {
                "create": {
                  "include": true
                },
                "update": {
                  "include": true
                }
              },
              "queries": {
