        },
        {
          "name": "returnProcessing",
          "type": "Boolean!",
          "description": "- **Description**: Dedicated areas for processing returned merchandise\n- **Characteristics**:Inspection stations\nSorting capabilities\nRepackaging equipment\n\n- **Best for**: Customer returns, damaged goods processing\n- **Layout considerations**: Often near receiving but separate from regular inventory",
          "metadata": {
            "mfgx": {
              "mutations": {
